### `.web-ban-grid.mob-2grid` — the 4-column badge grid (used on scope)
```css
/* Base: this class combo renders as 4 boxes in a flex row */
.web-ban-grid {
  grid-column-gap: 16px;
  grid-row-gap: 16px;
  grid-template-rows: auto;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr .75fr .85fr 1fr;
  grid-auto-columns: 1fr;
  max-width: none;
  margin-bottom: 0;
  display: flex;
}

.web-ban-grid.mob-2grid {
  grid-column-gap: 16px;
  grid-row-gap: 16px;
  flex: 0 auto;
  grid-template-rows: auto;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  grid-auto-columns: 1fr;
  width: auto;
  display: flex;     /* still flex row on desktop */
}
```

